{"originalLanguage":"en","title":"Whiskey and Morphine","artist":"Alexander Jean","date":"2026-07-28","sourceId":"14411850:008","sourceHash":"06d9b067a1248fcee7eb62dd4bb4ef5772c355bacb8ff5270167598e70bac15f","duration":309.5,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":19.586032,"end":23.721032,"text":"I'm wanted for addiction","translation":"난 중독으로 수배됐어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":23.858503,"end":29.689932,"text":"She's feening for a thrill","translation":"그녀는 자극에 굶주려 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":29.709932,"end":34.029932,"text":"We've been screamin' for attention, hmm","translation":"우린 관심을 얻겠다고 소리쳐 왔어 흠","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":34.226213,"end":38.783212999999996,"text":"Any little thing to numb this hell","translation":"이 지옥을 무디게 할 건 뭐든","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":39.032744,"end":45.032744,"text":"Oh every now and then I like to get me some, to get me some","translation":"가끔은 나도 좀 가져야 해 좀 가져야 해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":46.30059,"end":50.053832,"text":"Oh even though it's just a phase","translation":"그저 한때일 뿐이어도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":50.073832,"end":56.073832,"text":"Oh, now I feel like I've been in a hit and run, this shit ain't fun","translation":"이젠 뺑소니를 당한 것 같아 이건 재미없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":57.237188,"end":61.40839,"text":"I'm still here and you've gone MIA","translation":"난 아직 여기인데 넌 종적을 감췄어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":61.42839,"end":67.02839,"text":"I've got whiskey and morphine","translation":"내겐 위스키와 모르핀이 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":67.303039,"end":73.215737,"text":"Rushing through me","translation":"내 안을 휩쓸고 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":73.235737,"end":75.145737,"text":"Stand some, move it quicker, then I'm running","translation":"잠깐 버티다 더 빨리 움직여 난 달려가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":75.244263,"end":77.639138,"text":"Even trippin' over absolutely nothing","translation":"아무것도 아닌 데에도 비틀거려","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":77.659138,"end":83.65913799999998,"text":"Thanks to w